        "id": 215992,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-04-12T20:37:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've tried to play Shining Force 2 a couple of times.&nbsp; I don't feel like it's aged well, it's hard to get into with modern sensibilities, and I'm a huge fan of tactical RPG's.</p><p>I wonder if there are any indie developers who'd want to build that fighting game for them?&nbsp; Mane6 is doing some great early access work on Them's Fightin' Herds, and given their company name, I can't imagine they have anything else they're working on (though they're far from finished).&nbsp; And they have experience working with a third-party artist.&nbsp; Lab Zero hasn't had a hit other than Skullgirls, and that would be a great engine to base a Sentinels fighting game on.&nbsp; Anyone else come to mind?</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:47:34.349Z",
